# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build output
build/
build-*/
twister-out/
twister-out.*/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# ------------------------------------------------- west workspace guard rails
# This repo is the MANIFEST repo; the workspace lives in the PARENT directory,
# so none of these should ever appear here.  They are listed anyway: running
# `west init` from inside the repo by mistake drops a multi-gigabyte Zephyr
# tree in the working directory, and `git add -A` after that is unrecoverable
# without a rewrite.
/.west/
/zephyr/
/modules/
/bootstrap.log
/.bootstrap-apt-done

# ----------------------------------------------------------- editor / OS junk
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- PRIVATE
# Job-search planning material must never reach a public repository.  It is
# kept outside this directory on purpose; these entries exist so that an
# accidental copy cannot be committed.
plan/
archive/
*_plan_*.md
淘宝采购清单.txt
淘寶採購清單.txt

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- measurement
# Raw captures ARE evidence and ARE committed -- `make evidence` regenerates
# every figure from them, which is what makes the timing numbers checkable
# rather than merely claimed.  See captures/README.md for the size policy.
# Nothing under captures/ is ignored by design.  Do not "clean this up".
